Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feelin'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,lucky, and getting a little target\Npractice in might do me a world of goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't returned to my normal\Nsize, I'd be dead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, time was on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wimp-ass shrinking down to nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,again was the best thing\Nto ever happen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, the bastard's still breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.52,0:00:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, could that chatty dickhead have\Npulled a one-two punch and weakened my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.60,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,stand's power when he shrunk my body he's\Non the move again come back little bummer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,i want him to taste some major pain but\Nfor now i gotta hide he's a loose cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if he finds me he'll do\Nwhatever it takes to make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,me squeal about the location\Nof the boss's daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:01:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so far, why is the\Nsidewalk so damn big?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my way, Dead tat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a fun ride. Chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a slippery one to say the least!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tiny feet break skin, you're doomed\Nto live out a life in a small small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's have a little chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati and crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they hiding the boss's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me, stronzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well get\Nit over with already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I actually value\Nthe lives of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never screw them\Nover like that! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia Girga, born a Leo in 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At the age of 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mama beside you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama had an eye sickness, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This dismal morning was the beginning of\Nwhat would become Narancia's new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.20,0:04:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Scusa, could you explain\Nsomething to me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering, how many minutes do\Nyou think it would take me to walk here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia had rebelled against his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He began to fraternize\Nwith the wrong crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,refusing to come home and surviving\Non whatever he stole that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it really worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have done it\Nwithout your info, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess, but shouldn't you be in school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You come from a decent family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, like I care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one thing matters in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're true friends. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you should dye\Nyour hair blonde like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You would look so damn cool. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the new hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a tool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you guys seen Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's been a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the very next day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your grubby hands on the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stronsanto, your thieving\Nass is going to jail me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.82,0:05:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't steal anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.04,0:05:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your breath, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A witness saw the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the blonde Terra who robbed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He bit me senseless and took all my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You better come clean, old bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.44,0:05:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent and you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your damn lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just confess already! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we need answers, but\Nyou have to let the boy go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, didn't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He was about to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She called me a blonde terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. He'd never...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think that. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia was released one year later,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but in extremely poor health the officer\Nhad injured his eye and the infection that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,resulted was unrelenting when he returned
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,home his friends were\Nunusually standoffish
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,disgusting his mom died\Nfrom that eye disease
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,how did they know that\Nwas a secret between big
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,bro and me wow so they\Nlet you out already you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and that infected eye\Nshould keep your distance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,from now on it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,big bro did it he was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,caught so he blamed me\Nbut the rumors surrounding
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that horrible eye disease\Nscared no one more than
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Naranja himself. This is\Nmy destiny. This disease
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,it's gonna kill me i'm gonna\Ndie just like mama he had
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,no home no shoulder to cry\Non and no hope to hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to he was 15 and awaiting\Nhis inevitable death how sad
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,he's just a kid yes but we\Nshould Keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The young man led Narancia\Ninto a local trattoria
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and had a word for his friend\Nand the maitre d'. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This kid needs a plate\Nof spaghetti pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can handle it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His friend asked not a single question,\Nand his face showed no sign of annoyance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He simply placed the plate\Nof food he had ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,for himself in front\Nof the disheveled boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He then made sure the boy\Nreceived proper medical treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Three weeks later...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why go to so much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no pretext.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome at my home,\Nthough the choice lies with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I strongly suggest you go\Nback home to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to go to school. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, are you by chance a mafioso?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back to that life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to work with you\Nand become a mafioso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some game we're\Nplaying, you eager shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever spew that kind\Nof asinine crap again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you the beating of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia took his words to heart and returned\Nhome to resume his studies at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But he learned his lesson, and\Nwould never trust his father again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why that guy got so\Nserious with me all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have\Nanything to work toward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But his anger had no resentment or hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing about it came across\Nlike it was meant to insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing like the way my\Ndad and those cops treated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it, it's like\Nhis words filled me with courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to be a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way to join\Nup with someone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Six months later,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia made up his mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and met with the Cape Polpo\Nwithout Pucciarati's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed the test and became a mafioso.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, if there ever was a time to\Nunburden yourself, that time would be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me where the girl is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl you want to abduct\Nisn't a mafioso or anything close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a freaking kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati knows how to respect a command,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but not when it comes\Nto foul shit like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called human decency!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave our word we would protect her,\Nand that's exactly what we're gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you should just give\Nup on the chivalry bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I put up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the least bit interested in that\Nheroic crap about friendship, loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and saving some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,all I care about is taking down the\Ngood old boss and enjoying a drug group?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,worth hundreds of billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking hundreds of billions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't think a few heads\Naren't gonna roll along the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That loot is ours for the taking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not turning back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she's the boss's blood daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,then you better bet your\Nass she's a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the boss wants to\Nkeep that all under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We could just unmask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A BIGGEST CLUE TO HIS IDENTITY!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the key to taking\Nhim down permanently! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that girl is a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know South America is\Nhome to the Southern Black Widow?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Its venom is particularly\Nlethal to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This one, on the other\Nhand, is non-venomous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.54,0:11:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught it in the sewer while\NI was dodging your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's completely harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I shouldn't say harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Since even the most benign spiders\Ndeliver a bit of toxin with their nibble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to paralyzing and\Ndevouring tiny pests like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it works like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bummer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear a thing I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand has got nothing on mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This bottle will be your\Nprivate arena, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me out of here, you ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, all its eyes are right on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of those eight peepers is\Nwatching your every teeny-weeny move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, I said let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, don't assume that its bite will\Nsend you to a swift and peaceful oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Its venom will first paralyze your\Nmuscles, rendering your body immobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's what happens after the\Nparalysis that's really terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll grab you and inject both the venom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and the digestive enzyme\Ndeep into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The deadly cocktail of\Nenzymes will then slowly but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,surely liquefy your insides\Ninto a pulp of viscous slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then slurpity slurp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind you'll be fully conscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning you'll be able to speak\Nas it's lunching on your flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But word to the wise, friend, I strongly\Nurge you to spill the beans now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me where you're\Nhiding that damn girl. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I really prefer not to have to watch a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,become the liquid lunch\Nof some giant spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A glass shard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he get that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's webbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But when did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoying the convulsions\Nand paralysis yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and come clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance\Nto save your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd ever gave to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight Eyes is pumping you full\Nof digestive enzymes as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your organs will melt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.44,0:13:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped it when you\Ntook out that glass shard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of a sudden, kid, I'm getting\Nreal glad I decided to pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To think, everything I need might be\Nright here on this tiny piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This here is a driving map of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The damn thing's covered\Nin pencil markings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone was trying not to get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be any dumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to follow your little\Npath back to where you started from!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is where you're keeping the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You came from a vineyard 20\Nkilometers to the southeast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.10,0:14:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy mille, Narancia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun being eaten alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See you when it's a Bites\Nspider here shits ya! Idiota!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,20 kilometers to the southeast,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find their boss's\Ndaughter ripe for the picking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to keep your trap shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My little bomber's ability detects\Nand follows traces of carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it's a colorless gas, and living\Norganisms aren't the only things that emit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The combustion of matter\Nalso gives off the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was chasing you earlier with Lil'\NBomber, I also happened to nail that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I'm pretty sure I turned\Nthat gas tank into Swiss cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.90,0:15:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell exactly where those\Nbullet holes are from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, looking back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember thinking those bullet holes\Nwere blazing when my radar picked them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the carbon dioxide made them\Neasy pickings for Lil' Bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So I fired away. You see,\NI wasn't actually shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,at the spider back\Nthere those bullet holes
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,were super tiny so it\Ntook a little while for
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,things to get cooking I\Nwas worried for a bit but
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What shitty luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All of that stuff I\Nbought is getting torched.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever will I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it sure feels great to not have to worry\Nabout giant-sized spider bites anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put your entire gang\Nof stones off of that, Katsune!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find your hideout!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You think your little vineyard is safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you've prepared yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Naranja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell puts a fire out with\Nblood from their cut wrist? Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's my move?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let him get away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to find\Nhim with Lil' Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so much for that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The radar can't find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Flames are in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.78,0:17:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor dumb Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you set the car on fire, the flames\Nare giving off too much carbon dioxide,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't use your\Nradar to pin me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, I guess it's\Nsafe to say that I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where to find the boss's daughter\NNow all I have to do is ditch this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,shithole and tell my team then we're\Ngonna blow you and your teammates to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassinations are what we do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our specialty. See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure we're square real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't ever have to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I win
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's so hard to pinpoint\Nyour nasty-ass breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, because of the\Nroaring fires blazing around us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll just have to\Nfeed those flames more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I light up this street,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby's Widow Assassin's gonna be crispier\Nthan the crust of a pizza margarita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned if you get\Naway from me, Formazio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are deranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even by psycho standards, you\Nactually set the damn street on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally showed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I don't have to burn\Ndown the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason that I asked if you were\Ninsane was because of your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're telling me to kill you and\Nstrike your ass down where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little firefest gave me the\Ncover I needed to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,at this distance, my stand is a hell\Nof a lot faster than yours. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiny Beats!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It really blows, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your\Nlittle shopping excursion
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't as cut and dried\Nas you thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Naranja.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, things are going to get\Na lot worse from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For all, you cojone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.48,0:19:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go shopping, they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission's a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All the money, all the March.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is a bunch of ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Run it by me again, Narancia?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It all burned up, I\Ntold you! No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The part about the enemy knowing\Nwhere we've been hiding But I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,took care of him right after You\Nreally think it's that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ujarati, we all need to get the hell out\Nof here, now How many times did I warn you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be commending him, I mean he\Ntook out one of our enemies after all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly guys, what else could he\Nhave really done in that situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that the Hitman team has\Nfigured out what we're up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,a sensible boss would tell his team\Nhow to get out of this awful mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should all stay right here, at\Nleast until we hear from the boss again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to the prodigy preach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't realize you were our advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we don't hear from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.48,0:20:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then all of us here would be\Nnothing but sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild guesses won't help us, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.15,0:20:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we just got a\Nmessage from the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:21:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss always sends his\Ndirectives to Kapos this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but this is the very first\None sent to Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll review the directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed to Pompeii.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have hidden a key somewhere\Nnear the Cave Cana mosaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Investigate, Ragazzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.36,0:21:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This hidden key operates\Nthe vehicle that will
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,allow you safe passage as\Nyou deliver my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of vehicle\Nwould allow us to do that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a helicopter think\Nabout it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so obvious with\Na helicopter we can go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,anywhere without being\Nfollowed Pompeii is about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,15 kilometers away from\Nhere we could get there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in an hour plenty of time\Nto find the key okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Fugo, Abbacchio, Giorno, you three\Nwill travel to Pompeii to secure that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.45,0:21:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and I will remain here and\Nprotect Trish from the Hitman team.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Retrieve the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Radio back when it's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when the rest of us\Nwill meet you with Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From there, we'll be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.16,0:22:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaky you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you won't be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, you got my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You got my mind, I don't\Nwant to do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do to show how
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,much I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do to show how
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,much I'm gonna freak you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
